  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Mayors for Good Governance: Regional Caravan and Leadership Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A leadership program empowering mayors to advance transparency, citizen participation, and integrity through Open Government principles. This program will focus on transparency, citizen participation, innovation, and ethical leadership. Through fellowship-based learning, mentoring, and peer exchanges, LEAP and M4GG Caravan will equip local leaders with the tools to implement participatory governance, promote open data and public engagement, and strengthen community-driven mechanisms that uphold integrity and public trust.</narrative>
  </description>
